---
description: Maintain separation of application responsibilities.
globs: ["*.py"]
alwaysApply: true
---

- Keep UI code in app.py.
- Keep workflow coordination in career_agent.py.
- Keep data loading in data_loader.py.
- Keep skill normalization in skill_engine.py.
- Keep recommendation scoring in recommendation_engine.py.
- Keep roadmap generation in roadmap_engine.py.
- Keep data validation in models.py.
- Do not mix UI code with scoring or roadmap logic.